s of each coaching stage.\n\nOur team of researchers is formed by three collaborating researchers from different universities with the common research interest of developing the capacity of English teachers. We have collaborated previously in the Reading Evaluation and Decoding System (READS) project under School of Educational Studies, University Sains Malaysia. As a team of researchers, our current topic of interest revolves around instructional coaching as a form of effective in-service professional development for teachers. As the",
