' performance with large effects. Such affective measures beyond the achievement measures should be given more attention for enhanced learning experience, bottom-up approach, and positive atmosphere in the English language intervention setting. \n\nSecond, in the intervention analysis, due to different variables measured in the between-group and withingroup studies, the k number quite varied.",
