ers' higher order competencies, focusing on metacognition, and social support. Seminal research on reciprocal teaching involved students with learning difficulties taking increased cognitive responsibility for teaching their peers key strategies for understanding, supported by social context (Palincsar & Brown, 1984). Reciprocal teaching",
